::doc Module-level NAME = <literal> bindings, incl. simple containers.
::keys ["64", "AnnAssign", "Assign", "Constant", "Name", "_FEAT_CAP", "_keep_literal", "append", "ast", "body", "dict", "id", "isinstance", "list", "str", "target", "targets", "value", "walk"]
::unit function py_features @89-109 #23629b8d
