::doc Discrete feature set of a Python unit (docstrings excluded).
::keys ["64", "Attribute", "Constant", "Expr", "Load", "Name", "_FEAT_CAP", "_keep_literal", "add", "ast", "attr", "body", "ctx", "dict", "frozenset", "get", "getattr", "id", "isinstance", "list", "set", "sorted", "str", "update", "value", "walk"]
::unit function js_module_consts @122-131 #ecb63eb6
